    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D, top down, adventure game.\u00a0 The gameplay consists of exploring and fighting monsters.\u00a0 \u00a0It also includes quests and item upgrades.\u00a0 \u00a0Upgrades can be purchased in a shop and meant to have fun mechanics as well as giving the player the ability to deal more damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It includes the following features and things to do:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost exploring subterranean labyrinths while fighting off monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons and health to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to villagers and sometimes frogs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of overworld areas including foggy bogs, icy forests, mushroom forests, and burning wastelands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 subterranean dungeons to get lost in.</p></li></ul>",
